.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH add 1  "add " 
.SH NAME
add \- Add a snippet (owner/name) to a collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBadd\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICOLLECTION\fR> <\fISNIPPET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a snippet (owner/name) to a collection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICOLLECTION\fR>
Collection name (yours)
.TP
<\fISNIPPET\fR>
Snippet reference: owner/name
